  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>PortModeNote</name>
    <text>Changing 'Set mode' stores the new operating mode on the NPort; it becomes active only after Save/Restart (which reboots the unit). In 'Dry run' the request is only logged in Last action.</text>
    <x>16</x>
    <y>660</y>
    <width>1208</width>
    <height>34</height>
